{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15848","headline":"送韦八少府判官归东京 · 崔峒","name":"送韦八少府判官归东京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玄成世业紫真官，文似相如貌胜潘。\n鸿鴈南飞人独去，云山一别岁将阑。\n清淮水急桑林晚，古驿霜多柿叶寒。\n琼树相思何日见，银钩数字莫爲难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔峒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15848.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15848","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}